-257bm-i2"],"evidence_ids":["mapping.long.record-257bm-i2"],"id":"long.record-257bm-i2","kind":"claim","label":"Long record Theorem 6.104 (An upper bound for a binary coefficient tail)","locator":"Long record Theorem 6.104, p. 74, label record:257bm-i2","source_id":"paper.long.pdf","statement":"*Let $c:\\mathbb{N}\\to\\mathbb{N}$ satisfy $c(n)\\le n$ for every $n$. Then\n$$\n\\sum_{r\\ge1}c(N+r)2^{-r}\\le N+2\\qquad(N\\ge0).\n$$\nIndeed, $c(N+r)\\le N+r$, while $\\sum_{r\\ge1}2^{-r}=1$ and $\\sum_{r\\ge1}r2^{-r}=2$. Thus the scaled tail is $O(N)$, and in particular $o(2^N)$, as required in Theorem 6.105. The coefficient bound also holds for Euler’s totient function.*","status":"unverified"},"ref":"sha256:264b08973a5f23b2f98ad989b0c1708096513d86929f19048623a2a9fe18092c/nodes/long.record-257bm-i2","relations":[{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:264b08973a5f23b2f98ad989b0c1708096513d86929f19048623a2a9fe18092c/nodes/long.record-257bm-i2","id":"sha256:264b08973a5f23b2f98ad989b0c1708096513d86929f19048623a2a9fe18092c/edges/%5B%22long.record-257bm-i2%22%2C%22lean.Erdos249257.binaryCoeffTail_div_pow_tendsto_zero%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","kind":"formalizes","record_ref":"sha256:264b08973a5f23b2f98ad989b0c1708096513d86929f19048623a2a9fe18092c/edges/%5B%22long.record-257bm-i2%22%2C%22lean.Erdos249257.binaryCoeffTail_div_pow_tendsto_zero%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","semantic_class":"formalization_correspondence","to":"sha256:264b08973a5f23b2f98ad989b0c1708096513d86929f19048623a2a9fe18092c/nodes/lean.Erdos249257.binaryCoeffTail_div_pow_tendsto_zero"},{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:264b08973a5f23b2f98ad989b0c1708096513d86929f19048623a2a9fe18092c/nodes/long.record-257bm-i2","id":"sha256:264b08973a5f23b2f98ad989b0c1708096513d86929f19048623a2a9fe18092c/edges/%5B%22long.record-257bm-i2%22%2C%22lean.Erdos249257.binaryCoeffTail_le%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","kind":"formalizes","record_ref":"sha256:264b08973a5f23b2f98ad989b0c1708096513d86929f19048623